{
  "pack": 1,
  "about": "The bust bank: a person on a menu is a head, a top, facial hair and hair stacked on one canvas (src/bench/bust.ts is the only reader). Round 3 (accepted by the owner Nov 10, 2026) gave six heads and six hairstyles in four colors for each sex. Round 4 (accepted Nov 11) made the clothes layers in colors: a shirt, a tie and a jacket, or one whole top, each color its own painting; it replaced round 3's tops, all but the women's denim, which round 4 does not paint. Nov 17 additions (#10070, in the game Nov 18): five head shapes per sex (`shapes`, the standard first), six skin shades (`tones`, lightest first), `heads` by shape then tone, more hairstyles and eight more tops per sex, a style's own painting for a head shape (`byShape`), and the pairs the art checks flag (`doNotCombine`: a head and a hair or facial hair piece, never drawn together).",
